    "title": "Time Integrated Radiative Forcing from North American NO&amp;lt;sub&amp;gt;X&amp;lt;/sub&amp;gt; Emissions: Climate Effect over 20- and 100-year Time Scales",
    "venue": {
        "name": "International Journal of Atmospheric and Oceanic Sciences",
